quadrantChart
title Work priorities
x-axis Low effort --> High effort
y-axis Low impact --> High impact
quadrant-1 Plan
quadrant-2 Prioritize
quadrant-3 Consider
quadrant-4 Reassess
classDef important color:#B45309,radius:9,stroke-color:#7C2D12,stroke-width:2px
classDef optional color:#7C3AED,radius:6
Opportunity:::important: [0.22, 0.74]
Investment:::important: [0.78, 0.76] color:#0369A1,radius:7,stroke-color:#075985,stroke-width:1px
Experiment:::optional: [0.28, 0.26]
Review: [0.72, 0.24]
